WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.301
Two brackets make a rectangle, and the rectangle has four pieces.

2
00:00:05.052 --> 00:00:08.277
x plus two across, and x plus three down.

3
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.580
Four pieces: x squared, two x, three x, and six.

4
00:00:13.281 --> 00:00:17.531
Make the two a minus one. That strip and the corner turn negative.
